{"id":"9a9e5effc5e197cf4dc577bb3d81631cee6c1a09","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1242087","title":"chatgpt 这个宠物关不掉吗？太碍事了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"CoderLim","excerpt":"OpenAI - @CoderLim - 明明已经点了收起宠物，动不动又冒出来了 ![]( https://i.imgur.com/DZo7KJ5.png) ![]( https://i.imgur.com/bK2fc5","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>明明已经点了收起宠物，动不动又冒出来了</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DZo7KJ5.png\"> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bK2fc5R.png\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/宠物\"><li></li> 宠物</a><a href=\"/tag/烦人\"><li></li> 烦人</a><a href=\"/tag/关闭\"><li></li> 关闭</a></P><p><span>12 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-15 13:43:51 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086304\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a4ee/59dd/7751_normal.png?m=1751373218\" alt=\"Visoar\" data-uid=\"7751\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Visoar\">Visoar</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 11:24:45 +08:00\">23h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>他有个快捷键。。。<br>默认好像是 ctrl 或者 option + 空格切换宠物显示/隐藏。<br>记得改掉</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086320\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e1e6a65dc06f9be10df1237bac567eb9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"vlink\" data-uid=\"678239\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vlink\">vlink</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 11:26:03 +08:00\">22h 59m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 4</span>\n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/28TbnT9.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/28TbnT9.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br>键盘快捷键里把显示虚拟宠物的快捷键清除了，默认是 Option+Space 。<br>昨天我也发现了，而且这个刚好和我的 Raycast 的唤起快捷键冲突了，导致昨天一使用 Raycast 的搜索就弹出宠物 😅。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086333\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6692903d4bab11363bce194260e5d6a4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"aru\" data-uid=\"42497\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aru\">aru</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 11:27:19 +08:00\">22h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>快捷键吧。比如 mac 虚拟宠物默认快捷键 ctrl+space ，关了一会儿就按一下输入法，开了。。。<br>在设置-键盘快捷键 找到显示虚拟宠物，将快捷键删除。<br>然后再隐藏宠物，以后就不会动不动又出现了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086368\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a29f/8767/543997_normal.png?m=1789442483\" alt=\"AriesZhou\" data-uid=\"543997\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AriesZhou\">AriesZhou</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 11:30:16 +08:00\">22h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>目前没有彻底禁用的入口，codex 只提供了隐藏功能，重启后还可能会出现。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086652\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/031b/9c8d/375269_normal.png?m=1736237077\" alt=\"dingwen07\" data-uid=\"375269\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dingwen07\">dingwen07</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 12:06:44 +08:00\">22h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>左下角头像/名字那个菜单里就可以关，不会自动打开的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086756\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1cb3090cbd9fc2e3558946acbccf09d0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Aleks\" data-uid=\"699176\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Aleks\">Aleks</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 12:42:53 +08:00\">21h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>默认快捷键太容易误触，先关闭然后取消快捷键激活就可以。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086817\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a4e6/d1ff/637883_normal.png?m=1787299326\" alt=\"spike0100\" data-uid=\"637883\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/spike0100\">spike0100</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 13:10:07 +08:00\">21h 15m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可以设置为只显示输入框。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18086884\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/373a/9420/284506_normal.png?m=1724288412\" alt=\"datadump\" data-uid=\"284506\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/datadump\">datadump</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 13:24:55 +08:00\">21h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我感觉这个宠物是程序员搞出来的，ai 一般不会干这种事</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"明明已经点了收起宠物，动不动又冒出来了 宠物 烦人 关闭12 replies • 2026-09-15 13:43:51 +08:00 3 Visoar 23h 1m ago 他有个快捷键。。。默认好像是 ctrl 或者 option + 空格切换宠物显示/隐藏。记得改掉 4 vlink 22h 59m ago 4 键盘快捷键里把显示虚拟宠物的快捷键清除了，默认是 Option+Space 。昨天我也发现了，而且这个刚好和我的 Raycast 的唤起快捷键冲突了，导致昨天一使用 Raycast 的搜索就弹出宠物 😅。 5 aru 22h 58m ago 快捷键吧。比如 mac 虚拟宠物默认快捷键 ctrl+space ，关了一会儿就按一下输入法，开了。。。在设置-键盘快捷键 找到显示虚拟宠物，将快捷键删除。然后再隐藏宠物，以后就不会动不动又出现了。 6 AriesZhou 22h 55m ago 目前没有彻底禁用的入口，codex 只提供了隐藏功能，重启后还可能会出现。 7 dingwen07 22h 19m ago 左下角头像/名字那个菜单里就可以关，不会自动打开的 8 Aleks 21h 43m ago 默认快捷键太容易误触，先关闭然后取消快捷键激活就可以。 10 spike0100 21h 15m ago via iPhone 可以设置为只显示输入框。 11 datadump PRO 21h 1m ago 我感觉这个宠物是程序员搞出来的，ai 一般不会干这种事","fetched_at":"2026-09-16T02:28:47.616Z","ok":true}